==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*2 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Chickful A]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**25 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Mr. Angel spam can be the death of a pure fodder lineup. Make sure to include area attacking fodder or even a less useful attacking unit such as [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Flying Cat]].

